{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於今日（11月17日）19時45分發出特別天氣提示，提醒市民一道位於華南北部的冷鋒正逐漸向南移動，預計明日（11月18日）稍後橫過廣東沿岸，屆時本港將有一兩陣雨，並於晚上氣溫顯著下降。\n</p>\n<p>隨後一兩日天氣將顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫預計在15至16度，新界地區則會再低兩至三度。此外，受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及星期六初時高地風寒效應將較為明顯，天氣寒冷。</p>\n<p>天文台呼籲市民，特別是進行戶外活動的人士，密切留意天氣變化，注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。請確保家中及戶外活動的保暖措施充足，以應對即將到來的寒冷天氣。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b7%e9%8b%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冷鋒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.274909+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:15:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:18.671655+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:18.671655+00:00","content_hash":"92920064d55e4386a1f1acbd3108128c7382b75895c91864a349ec3dc277ca96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}